    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "/rendered-verification — look at it, then send the picture",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-09-22: *\"use playwright to confirm UI changes and share\nscreenshots back to me/user.\"*",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Why a green gate set does not cover this",
      "prov:value": "| what happened | why the suite was green |\n|---|---|\n| `gjli` — a generator emitted raw `<h3>`, kramdown assigned no ids, and **all 22 headings on a page shared one anchor** | the generator's own output looked right |\n| `sjic` — the rail rested at 40px and the sidebar at 56px, called \"the same navbar\" | each file had a test asserting **its own copy** |\n| the harness dividers rendered with **no colour and no stripe** | an invalid custom-property substitution fails *silently* — no parse error, no console warning, just the initial value |\n| home laid out at **y=1510 in a 900px viewport**, rendered and unreachable | the markup was correct; a `!important` in the theme made the flex column inert |"
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Running it here",
      "prov:value": "**And check that the state actually changed.** This session set\n`data-fa-scheme=\"light\"` directly, measured the page still dark, and was\none step from reporting a contrast failure that did not exist — the real\ntoggle is `jtd.setTheme(name)`."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Running it here",
      "prov:value": "That was the owner's *\"flashes white before goignt o\ndark mode\"* (2026-09-24).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-24"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The REAL build is reachable — take it off `gh-pages`",
      "prov:value": "Until 2026-09-23 that was advice with\nno method: this environment's proxy refuses `litlfred.github.io`, so the\npreview could be named and not opened.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-23"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Assert the CONDITIONS, or the check passes over nothing",
      "prov:value": "Measured 2026-09-23: a first run mounted at the wrong path reported **both\npages passing** — over a page with **zero stylesheets loaded**.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-23"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Assert the CONDITIONS, or the check passes over nothing",
      "prov:value": "This\nis `dh4f` in a browser: could-not-determine rendered as a pass."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A COUNT over the built site needs its instrument validated first",
      "prov:value": "Measured on bean `oi1y` (2026-09-24): counting navigated pages took five\ninstruments, and four gave a confident wrong number.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean oi1y",
        "2026-09-24"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Visible is not usable — hit-test the control's CENTRE",
      "prov:value": "Found this way on 2026-09-23 (bean `tcq2`): the search field had the right\nwidth, the right height and the right colours, and a hit test at its centre\nreturned `P.fa-search-notice`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean tcq2",
        "2026-09-23"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-10",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Visible is not usable — hit-test the control's CENTRE",
      "prov:value": "And the reason this is a usability check rather than a nicety: where the\ncovered control is the ONLY route back to a state — the magnifier that\nreopens a collapsed search — being un-clickable is `l4zi`, an action whose\ninverse is not reachable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Accessibility is measured here too",
      "prov:value": "`gjli` is the standing rule and the 3:1 bar for meaningful non-text content\nis `y8cm`'s."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/ui/ui-core/rendered-verification.md#provenance-12",
